  "translated_count": 20,
  "entries": [
    {"uid":"zhcn:e27923954e69e367bf1b74f3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"听见了吗！？\r\n刚刚有人提到风风喔！\r\n嘿嘿嘿，眼光真好啊！","source_fingerprint":"a5f8ee0b1f243b3614720a1abed1d05d320482e4987ffeb88085193db334eaaa","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20026"],"entry_index":40,"target_text":"Nghe thấy không!?\r\nVừa có người nhắc tới Windy đó!\r\nHehehe, có mắt nhìn thật!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:8eebc3f6a562ac3aa4e848c2","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风去对一个自以为老大的家伙\r\n做了鬼脸喔！当然比赛中也要\r\n让她吓一跳！","source_fingerprint":"b16730c6a345f667402495b4c718778793134e851fe4740b818096427b85d8a2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20027"],"entry_index":41,"target_text":"Windy vừa làm mặt xấu với một kẻ\r\ntự cho mình là đại ca! Tất nhiên trong race\r\ncũng phải làm cô ta giật mình!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:875928b41ff9cc443a25b790","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哼，每个人的表情都不赖嘛！\r\n虽然还是完～全\r\n赢不过风风啦！","source_fingerprint":"6b4daa5aea5f75969b3a0529d502e7ec3e9e457a89e0ce7cb4de49eff1945e7a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20028"],"entry_index":42,"target_text":"Hừm, vẻ mặt ai cũng khá đấy!\r\nDù vẫn hoàn～toàn\r\nkhông thắng nổi Windy!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:2eb216f70515762e902ad31f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"喂，手下！\r\n仔细看着老大的跑姿啊！","source_fingerprint":"be8142d480c0326cb206256810d441d227563bae8778855d5e262bae8d95b299","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20029"],"entry_index":43,"target_text":"Này, thuộc hạ!\r\nNhìn kỹ dáng chạy của đại ca đi!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:ce66b0e8f8e51e6e91c3b9d3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"一口气深深咬下！\r\n要在比赛中留下咬痕喔～！","source_fingerprint":"48888689b69df770b39ad02ede9852e6a449ada08957571a5b4bca5079b07e3d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20030"],"entry_index":44,"target_text":"Cắn thật sâu một phát!\r\nPhải để lại dấu răng trong race～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:796b796ff0190e110ab6ce9d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"妈妈说她会看转播！\r\n风风要超～级吸睛喔～！","source_fingerprint":"5f39d733a87142a143c52450c4b0d04e9b4b778d4e105d0a13809c13388680d8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20031"],"entry_index":45,"target_text":"Mẹ nói sẽ xem truyền hình trực tiếp!\r\nWindy phải siêu～nổi bật mới được～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:359484ac6b0fe8ef638983e4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯～？总觉得哪里怪怪的耶。\r\n风风明明把牙齿刷干净了……","source_fingerprint":"0ed1614cb3de2254c94748701e728ffc3a0d63b8702d373083a56163861c06b4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20032"],"entry_index":46,"target_text":"Hửm～? Cứ thấy có gì đó lạ lạ.\r\nWindy rõ ràng đã đánh răng sạch rồi mà…","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:499dd8cbad7efcf7f4ac626b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风想快点去比赛啦～！\r\n风风觉得无聊了～！","source_fingerprint":"c64a941aa83f6aaef39feb1f684d2a2176274d23cd98aceba8c98f0814e9f717","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20033"],"entry_index":47,"target_text":"Windy muốn đi race ngay rồi～!\r\nWindy chán quá～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:42d2d2d0d34f4e11b8f83b21","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好没劲～对了！\r\n训练员，你自己下去跑\r\n应该会更有趣喔！","source_fingerprint":"4b0c284edc05e46c843c46372e9c889cd614557f92b76d0bc95e57b9bc888d9d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20034"],"entry_index":48,"target_text":"Chán quá～ đúng rồi!\r\nTrainer, bạn tự xuống chạy\r\nchắc sẽ vui hơn đấy!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:42d765677d7d8da21a50b44a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"无论遇到什么危机风风都不会退缩！\r\n不坚持到最后一个步骤\r\n就不叫恶作剧了！","source_fingerprint":"958d45ebf0e33b305368a0048d8b9daf7531f6f5b8cea27219b447fa1fe69a43","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20035"],"entry_index":49,"target_text":"Dù gặp nguy hiểm gì Windy cũng không lùi bước!\r\nKhông làm tới bước cuối cùng\r\nthì sao gọi là nghịch phá được!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:0341fca54f6f365d430bb401","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔……风风……\r\n是、最强……的喔……","source_fingerprint":"3f035b04c16b068ed19d4bbee941c5ee355c0d07ddb3d223b02b0de977fa415d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20036"],"entry_index":50,"target_text":"Ư ư… Windy…\r\nlà… mạnh nhất… đó…","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:c649feb68805b8eb55e8d6d1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风不想就这样结束！\r\n大家……大家，快点……\r\n看过来啊……！","source_fingerprint":"e56f89608331fad33f41d104cbe146ad28dcec7b453895db4b067bc0119cefd3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20037"],"entry_index":51,"target_text":"Windy không muốn kết thúc thế này!\r\nMọi người… mọi người, mau…\r\nnhìn sang đây đi…!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:10b3d7c457c1561530de7d92","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哒哒──！","source_fingerprint":"9b0fd0e823b631eab22caf2344ad0563fc84f860cc85f807430441c05bf1c47d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20038"],"entry_index":52,"target_text":"Dada──!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:97d84c459a9bc4a455d70017","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"吼──！！","source_fingerprint":"ff1bf19c4d41be675008eba348de111ecda8a4852b247ac305c2f0b2c3a7a4ba","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20039"],"entry_index":53,"target_text":"Gào──!!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:2e38a31e8e8ae941a818f53c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"做就对了！","source_fingerprint":"c2d31962fa2b64977e9016466ad7825c54e72650061f563f7b5d4a3722f6807f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20040"],"entry_index":54,"target_text":"Cứ làm là được!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:e1daa17e8019e2b41048ac7a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"念、念书……","source_fingerprint":"597ceda1fc716da72e2b7e8f3a25f57170fd3eb8872793d131298b3ec19194e9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20041"],"entry_index":55,"target_text":"Học… học bài…","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:09e6ae74c74fe18c80200331","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔哇──！？","source_fingerprint":"d2b3a8cbd9e9924b0a2863b0bb78dd8450667bb48fd440e1802583b95918d7bb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20042"],"entry_index":56,"target_text":"Uwaa──!?","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:3b70da20b3895eecf5730d72","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔啊啊～！","source_fingerprint":"f1edd9d63b48c4d8245b822f3f735b139f7852b078f7dee2563d3d9bc4f6d477","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20043"],"entry_index":57,"target_text":"Uwaaa～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:572b37dd7416d6158e2d09ed","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"跟风风来吧！","source_fingerprint":"ee90cf9d3e78522ad2c402c8c8bb3b71bd8b3523f88d6ebd3674fda2001510e2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20046"],"entry_index":58,"target_text":"Theo Windy nào!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:b76ed35aaab601cdea78eb90","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":" 啪唰──！！","source_fingerprint":"75441c5b7abe27d584573be4e410633843ef4036ce8b8d28a8a6a8d29afa6687","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20047"],"entry_index":59,"target_text":" Phạch──!!","reviewed":true}
  ]
}
